        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Ski-Doo Snowmobile Challenge is a snowmobile racing game and a follow up to the PlayStation 2 game Ski-Doo Snow X Racing. The game is similar to its predecessor but has a larger number of tracks, with 25 different events taking place in five different countries: Canada, Russia, Sweden, USA and Norway. There are four different types of events: cross country, snowcross, hill cross and freestyle.\n\nLike other extreme sports games doing tricks is a central part of the game.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Ski-Doo Snowmobile Challenge es un juego de carreras de motonieves y la continuación del juego de PlayStation 2 Ski-Doo Snow X Racing. Es similar a su predecesor, pero cuenta con un mayor número de circuitos: 25 eventos diferentes en cinco países: Canadá, Rusia, Suecia, Estados Unidos y Noruega. Hay cuatro tipos de eventos: cross country, snowcross, hill cross y freestyle.\n\nAl igual que en otros juegos de deportes extremos, hacer trucos es una parte central del juego.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
